:"GMP fundamentals"},{"text":"Documentation"},{"text":"Risk assessment"},{"text":"QbD concepts"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Portfolio"},{"type":"p","text":"At least 3–5 formulation/product-development projects, including:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Formulation prototype"},{"text":"Stability study"},{"text":"Analytical characterization"},{"text":"DOE-based optimization"},{"text":"Industry-oriented formulation project"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Best Overall Positioning"},{"type":"p","text":"Instead of:"},{"type":"h","text":"“B.Sc Chemistry graduate looking for a formulation job.”"},{"type":"p","text":"Build the profile as:"},{"type":"p","text":"“Chemistry graduate specializing in formulation development, analytical characterization, stability testing, experimental optimization and data-driven R&D.”"},{"type":"p","text":"For pharmaceutical formulation specifically:"},{"type":"p","text":"“Chemistry graduate with formulation development, analytical characterization, stability, QbD/DOE and GMP-oriented R&D skills.”"},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended Career Pathways"},{"type":"table","header":["Pathway","Core Combination"],"rows":[[{"text":"Pharmaceutical Formulation"},{"text":"Chemistry + Formulation + Analytical + GMP"}],[{"text":"Cosmetic Formulation"},{"text":"Chemistry + Ingredients + Stability + Product Development"}],[{"text":"Agrochemical Formulation"},{"text":"Chemistry + Formulation + Materials + Testing"}],[{"text":"Specialty Chemicals"},{"text":"Chemistry + Materials + Process Development"}],[{"text":"Polymer Formulation"},{"text":"Polymer Chemistry + Rheology + Materials"}],[{"text":"Analytical R&D"},{"text":"Analytical Chemistry + Instrumentation + Method Development"}],[{"text":"Product Development"},{"text":"Formulation + Testing + Scale-Up"}],[{"text":"Computational Formulation"},{"text":"Chemistry + Python + Data + ML"}],[{"text":"Sustainable Formulation"},{"text":"Green Chemistry + Materials + Formulation"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Final Career Equation"},{